OL,3,GNEWSARail services and discounts are
OL,4,Ahit in Translink cutbacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FLate-night train services in Northern
OL,7,FIreland are to be reduced and some fare
OL,8,Fdiscounts are to be lowered as part of
OL,9,Fnew cost-cutting measures.
OL,11,FThe reduction in train services after
OL,12,F22:00 GMT will be on Mondays, Tuesdays
OL,13,Fand Wednesdays from April next year.
OL,15,FThe 25% discount for off-peak travel on
OL,16,Ftrains and Ulsterbus services will be
OL,17,Fremoved later this month and the price
OL,18,Fof some family tickets will go up.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
